.TH QUIPU-RESTORE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-restore \- Replace the store with a full pack, binary or text
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu restore\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIfull\-pack\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace the store with a full pack, binary or text
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIfull\-pack\fR>

